@startuml
!define REGISTER_WIDTH 16

rectangle "Block Count Register (Offset 006h)" as BCR {
  rectangle "D15...D00" as bits #lightgray {
    label "Blocks Count For Current Transfer" as field
  }
}

note right of BCR
  **Location:** 15-00
  **Attribute:** RW (Read/Write)
  
  **Register Field Explanation:**
  Blocks Count For Current Transfer
  
  • Enabled when Block Count Enable = 1
  • Valid only for multiple block transfers
  • Value: 1 to maximum block count
  • Decrements after each block transfer
  • Stops when count reaches zero
  • Setting to 0 = no data blocks transferred
  
  **Access Rules:**
  • Access only when no transaction executing
  • Read during transfer may return invalid value
  • Write operations during transfer are ignored
  
  **Suspend/Resume:**
  • Read to determine blocks yet to be transferred
  • Restore saved block count before resume
  
  **Value Examples:**
  FFFFh = 65535 blocks
  0002h = 2 blocks
  0001h = 1 block
  0000h = Stop Count
end note

@enduml